{{define "content"}}
<section class="welcome-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">天主教版单身交友</p>
  <h1 class="welcome-title">一线牵</h1>
  <p class="welcome-lead">认真信仰，也认真寻找另一半。<br>在主的爱内相遇，在真实资料与人工审核中安心认识彼此。</p>
  <div class="welcome-actions">
    {{if .User}}
    <a class="button primary block" href="/cards">进入一线牵</a>
    <a class="button block" href="/profile">我的资料</a>
    {{else}}
    <a class="button primary block" href="/register?from=welcome">立即注册</a>
    <a class="button block" href="/login">已有账号，登录</a>
    {{end}}
  </div>
  <p class="welcome-note">免费注册 · 人工审核 · 手机号码即可登录</p>
</section>

<section class="welcome-features" aria-label="一线牵特色">
  <article class="welcome-feature">
    <svg class="welcome-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"></path>
    </svg>
    <h2>认真配对</h2>
    <p>异性卡片浏览、喜欢与留言，资料分区清楚，不用重新学习。</p>
  </article>
  <article class="welcome-feature">
    <svg class="welcome-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.5-3 7.5-7 9-4-1.5-7-4.5-7-9V6z"></path>
      <path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"></path>
    </svg>
    <h2>真实审核</h2>
    <p>注册资料由小天使人工审核；身份证只供保险与核对，不对外显示。</p>
  </article>
  <article class="welcome-feature">
    <svg class="welcome-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M12 3v18"></path>
      <path d="M7 9h10"></path>
    </svg>
    <h2>信仰同行</h2>
    <p>教会、团体与活动资讯一起呈现，让彼此从共同信仰开始认识。</p>
  </article>
</section>

<section class="welcome-steps">
  <h2>如何加入</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>填写资料</strong>：手机号码、基本资料与 3–9 张照片。</li>
    <li><strong>设定密码</strong>：注册时直接设定，之后用手机号码＋密码登录。</li>
    <li><strong>等待审核</strong>：小天使确认资料后开通，站内通知你。</li>
  </ol>
  <a class="button primary block" href="/register?from=welcome">开始填写注册表</a>
</section>

<section class="welcome-footer-note">
  <p>一线牵 · 遇见对的人</p>
  <p class="hint">已有账号？<a href="/login">使用手机号码与密码登录</a>。</p>
</section>
{{end}}
